  ('c021d0be-9711-5285-bc2b-ca7cbf3b53ed', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g12-paragraph-transitions'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Read: "The orchestra's new conductor shortened each rehearsal by twenty minutes. ____, the musicians reported feeling better prepared for concerts, since every remaining minute was spent on the hardest passages." Which transition best completes the sentences?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Previously,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"time-for-concession"},{"text":"Similarly,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"comparison-for-concession"},{"text":"Even so,","is_correct":true},{"text":"For instance,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-concession"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Even so,$q$, $q$Shorter rehearsals would normally leave musicians less prepared, so "Even so" signals the unexpected result that follows. "Previously" is wrong because the musicians' improved preparation came after the change, not before it.$q$, 'draft', null)
