  ('070db04b-432a-551e-bacd-bd5f9b1327d4', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g12-paragraph-transitions'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Read: "Solar panels produce the most electricity around midday. ____, demand for power in many homes peaks in the early evening, when families return from work and school." Which transition best completes the sentences?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Therefore,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"cause-for-contrast"},{"text":"In addition,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"addition-for-contrast"},{"text":"For example,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-contrast"},{"text":"However,","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$However,$q$, $q$The two sentences describe a mismatch between when panels produce power and when homes need it, so "However" signals the contrast. "Therefore" is wrong because midday production does not cause evening demand.$q$, 'draft', null)
