   $q$Read: "Some animals change color for reasons other than hiding from predators. ____, certain lizards turn darker on cool mornings so that their skin absorbs more of the sun's heat." Which transition best completes the sentences?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Nonetheless,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"concession-for-example"},{"text":"In conclusion,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"summary-for-example"},{"text":"For instance,","is_correct":true},{"text":"Otherwise,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"condition-for-example"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$For instance,$q$, $q$The second sentence gives a specific case of an animal changing color for a reason other than hiding, so "For instance" introduces it as an example. "Nonetheless" is wrong because the lizard example supports the first sentence instead of working against it.$q$, 'draft', null)
