  ('c460cf15-942d-5125-84ed-c1e308609a12', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g12-paragraph-transitions'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Read: "Warmer ocean water holds less dissolved oxygen. ____ fish that need oxygen-rich water move toward cooler areas. ____ the fishing fleets that depend on those fish must travel farther from port." Which pair of transitions best completes the sentences?$q$, $q$[{"text":"As a result, / In turn,","is_correct":true},{"text":"For example, / Similarly,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-effect"},{"text":"However, / Therefore,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contrast-for-effect"},{"text":"As a result, / Nevertheless,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"concession-breaks-chain"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$As a result, / In turn,$q$, $q$Each sentence is caused by the one before it, so "As a result" and "In turn" keep the chain of effects clear. "As a result, / Nevertheless" starts correctly but then wrongly treats the fleets' longer trips as a contrast instead of the next effect.$q$, 'draft', null)
